  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kRsZVu69/images/90c8f558cdc23936208212115546a2f56ddb9fe7.jpeg\" alt=\"中国神话混搭包封面\"></p><h1>中国神话混搭包</h1><hr><a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"github-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"ghsponsors-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrandonitaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a><p>踏上史诗般的地貌旅程，在龙之国度寻找启迪——这款混搭包灵感来源于中国神话传说。</p><p>本包为方块、物品、实体、界面添加了主题纹理，并包含全新音乐！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kRsZVu69/images/e00f34958e6ff03154ab4e81de5b427f7fb13f49.jpeg\" alt=\"世界预览\"></p><hr><p>本资源包是《中国神话混搭》从遗产主机版移植至基岩版的版本，并采用了基岩版更新后的纹理。原始纹理由4J Studios制作。</p>",
